 then $A_a^x \otimes I_\bob \simeq_{\eps + 2\sqrt{\delta + \gamma}} I_\alice \otimes  D_a^x$.
\end{fact}

\begin{fact}[Data processing, Fact 4.26 in~\cite{NW19}]
